{"version":1,"content":"<p>OpenAI於11月23日宣佈，面向ChatGPT推出GPT-6.2 Sol的聊天專用版本，並開始向Plus、Pro、Business和Enterprise用户分批開放。這是GPT-6.2系列繼此前進入ChatGPT Work和Codex之後，首次正式擴展至ChatGPT日常聊天界面。</p> <a href=\"https://www.cnbeta.com.tw/articles/tech/1587728.htm\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><strong>閲讀全文</strong></a>","scraped_at":"2026-11-24T02:43:55.440303+00:00","quality":{"score":0,"chars":148,"images":0,"source":"cnBeta","fallback":"rss-budget","origin":"rss","completeness":"unverified"},"published_at":"2026-11-24T02:24:17+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-24T02:37:15.075008+00:00","content_hash":"d264309dba197cf84fde356526025052e2a968b953dccfeb196f2caf0169ec52","evidence_status":"partial","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}